# Solitaired Overview
Solitaired offers free, instant-play solitaire and card games designed to help players relax, challenge themselves, and build confidence with brain-training tools.

## Main Games
- [Solitaire](https://solitaired.com/): Play the flagship solitaire experience with customizable deals.
- [Spider Solitaire](https://solitaired.com/spider-solitaire): Tackle one-, two-, and four-suit variants.
- [FreeCell](https://solitaired.com/freecell): Plan every move in this deterministic favorite.
- [Pyramid](https://solitaired.com/pyramid-solitaire): Clear paired cards and race the clock.
- [TriPeaks](https://solitaired.com/tripeaks-solitaire): Chain ascending and descending runs.
- [Mahjong](https://solitaired.com/mahjong): Match tiles across curated layouts.
- [Yahtzee](https://solitaired.com/yahtzee): Roll to build the best scoring combinations.
- [Klondike](https://solitaired.com/klondike-solitaire): Focus on classic draw-one and draw-three play.
- [Hearts](https://solitaired.com/hearts): Avoid the queen and shoot the moon.
- [Spades](https://solitaired.com/spades): Bid smart and win tricks with a partner.
- [All 500 Free Games](https://solitaired.com/free-games): Browse every card and puzzle title.

## Platform Highlights
- Play in any modern browser on desktop, tablet, or mobile without downloads; installable progressive web app support keeps sessions fast.
- Personalize play with large-print cards, left-handed layouts, hints, undo, and theming so more players can enjoy longer sessions.
- Opt into a free account to sync progress, store favorite decks, and unlock winnable deal libraries curated by Solitaired experts.
- Learning content and onboarding tips accompany each game, helping new players understand rules, scoring, and strategy in minutes.

